Battle for Dream Island Elsewhere (BFDIE) is the sixth season of Battle for Dream Island, an American animated web series created by twin brothers Cary and Michael Huang. The season is currently ongoing, and follows 12 anthropomorphic objects competing for an island where they can imprison others in. Episodes are released weekly, and all episodes of the entire series; this season included, along with related media is released onto their YouTube channel, jacknjellify.
Overview
This season revolves around a competition during the events of season 1. It centers around a competition between 12 anthropomorphic objects for an island to trap other contestants in. Every episode, the host picks a challenge for the characters to complete. The character to complete the challenge last is eliminated. While characters occasionally die throughout the season, they can be brought back to life with machines called "recovery centers".
